OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy day with a few
OL,6,Foutbreaks of light rain or drizzle in
OL,7,Fthe east. Western parts, including the
OL,8,FMoray coast, will see some brighter
OL,9,Fand sunnier spells. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with a few
OL,13,Foutbreaks of light rain and drizzle,
OL,14,Fmainly towards eastern coasts.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day
OL,17,Fwith some light rain and drizzle
OL,18,Fpossible in the east but dry with
OL,19,Fbrighter spells in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
